/*
 * Unused for now. The idea is that ducklings would land, chill out, lower stress, then leave. They would leave if a dangerous event
 *  starts, giving the player a heads up. They can leave by being pulled under the water by something, giving stress.
 */
:: Fishing Ducklings Arrive
<<if $bus is "fishingMoor">>
	<<set $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.phase to "present">>
	<<set $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.age to 0>>
	<<fishingLocationDescription "moor">>
<<else>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.phase to "present">>
	<<set $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.age to 0>>
	<<fishingLocationDescription "forestLake">>
<</if>>
<br><br>

A duck wades out from the bank a few paces away, followed by a line of ducklings, peeping as they hit the water.
<br><br>

<<if $bus is "fishingMoor">>
	<<link [[Wait for a bite (0:05)|Fishing Moor Wait Loop]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<run stopFishingProp()>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Wait for a bite (0:05)|Fishing Forest Lake Wait Loop]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Lake Fishing Rock]]>><<run stopFishingProp()>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Ducklings Wait Ambient [widget]
<<widget "fishingDucklingsWaitAmbient">>
	<<if _args[0] is "moor">>
		<<set $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.age to $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.age + 1>>
		<<set _ducklingsAge to $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.age>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.age to $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.age + 1>>
		<<set _ducklingsAge to $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.age>>
	<</if>>
	<<set _ducklingsLeaveChance to Math.min(0.5, _ducklingsAge * 0.04)>>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The ducklings jostle together behind their mother, cheeping softly.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		One of the ducklings pecks at something floating on the surface, a leaf, or a bubble.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		A duckling flaps its tiny wings against the water, splashing the water around.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The mother lets out a low quack and the ducklings draw in close around her.
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<addinlineevent _ducklingsLeaveChance>>
		The mother quacks once, sharp and clear, and begins swimming steadily toward the far bank. The ducklings fall in behind her in a bobbing line, shrinking with distance until they clamber up the far side and march single-file into the undergrowth.
		<<if _args[0] is "moor">>
			<<set $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.phase to "finished">>
		<<else>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.phase to "finished">>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<addinlineevent 0.02>>
		Without warning, one of the ducklings is simply gone, pulled under in an instant. The water closes over the spot, still churning. The mother calls out sharply and the remaining ducklings scatter toward the bank. She drives them out of the water and up through the grass without looking back. <<gstress>><<stress 4>>
		<<if _args[0] is "moor">>
			<<set $daily.fishing.moor.ducklings.phase to "finished">>
		<<else>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.lake.ducklings.phase to "finished">>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>
